  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Middle East and North Africa Regional Humanitarian Response.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide support to the MENA region to respond to crises in order to:
Save lives and prevent suffering via humanitarian support, including to international partners.
Facilitate the enabling environment of the humanitarian response in country, through close engagement with national authorities and humanitarian partners, and advocacy towards effective coordination.
Maximise impact, promote UK leadership and strengthen bilateral relations with partner Governments.</narrative>
  </description>
